============================================================
17. PRODUCT NAMING RULES
============================================================

Future OX-DX products must satisfy:

1. clear responsibility
2. clear boundary
3. no semantic overlap
4. no duplicate ownership
5. no unnecessary renaming
6. no religious appropriation
7. no marketing hype in technical names

Products should be understandable without the brand.

Example:

OX-DX Web
OX-DX Docs
OX-DX CLI

is acceptable.

Random invented names for the same capability are not.

============================================================
18. NO DUPLICATE OWNERSHIP
============================================================

This is critical.

One capability must have one clear owner.

Example:

Ontology definition
→ Specification

Ontology implementation
→ Engine

CLI interaction
→ Tool

Public presentation
→ Web

Documentation
→ Docs

Visual identity
→ Brand assets

Do not allow:

website to redefine ontology

CLI to redefine ontology

docs to redefine schema

marketing to redefine technical semantics

This prevents ecosystem drift.

