# ============================================================ 28. BRAND EXTENSION RULE

Future brand extensions must follow:

OX-DX + clear noun

Examples:

OX-DX Web
OX-DX Docs
OX-DX CLI
OX-DX SDK

Avoid:

OX-DX AI
OX-DX Pro
OX-DX Ultra
OX-DX Quantum
OX-DX X
OX-DX 360

unless a real product reason exists.

Do not create naming for marketing's sake.

# ============================================================ 29. QURANIC NAMING BOUNDARY

Because OX-DX has Quranic philosophical inspiration:

Do NOT casually use sacred names for tools, services, algorithms, or commercial sub-products.

Do NOT manufacture Arabic names to make technology look profound.

Do NOT claim divine authority through product names.

Quranic inspiration belongs primarily in:

philosophy
manifesto
worldview
visual geometry
reflection

Technical product naming remains precise and neutral.

# ============================================================ 30. GEN-Z / GRUNGE NAMING BOUNDARY

Names may be short and memorable.

They may have attitude.

But foundational infrastructure must remain understandable.

Avoid meme names for:

ontology
schema
graph
engine
identity
core libraries

Gen-Z belongs in:

voice
presentation
campaigns
visual identity

not in making technical architecture confusing.

# ============================================================ 31. INTELLIGENT NAMING RULE

The more foundational the component:

the more precise its name should be.

Brand:
OX-DX

System:
Universal Ontology & Experience Engine

Engine:
Universal Ontology Engine

Crate:
ontology-graph

File:
universal-ontology-v1.0.json

This progression should become a model for the entire ecosystem.

